# The frontend Vercel project's Root Directory setting is "frontend", but
# `vercel --prod` run from the repo root (needed so that setting resolves
# correctly — see prior deploy notes) uploads the *whole* repo first. These
# directories are irrelevant to that deploy and, in desktop/'s case, contain
# files well over Vercel's 100MB upload limit (the packaged installer .exe,
# node_modules).
desktop/node_modules
desktop/release
mobile/node_modules
backend/node_modules
